---
// hero 产品演示窗口：仿 ZCode 官网的「应用界面 mock」手法（HTML/CSS 实现，非截图）。
// 窗口内展示 ZCode 会话 + 右下角 Z-Buddy 状态条；文案用真实产品语料。
import { withBase } from '../data/site';
---

<div class="glass-panel overflow-hidden rounded-2xl shadow-2xl">
  <!-- 标题栏 -->
  <div class="flex items-center gap-2 border-b border-white/10 px-4 py-3">
    <span class="h-3 w-3 rounded-full bg-[#ff5f57]"></span>
    <span class="h-3 w-3 rounded-full bg-[#febc2e]"></span>
    <span class="h-3 w-3 rounded-full bg-[#28c840]"></span>
    <span class="ml-3 font-mono text-xs text-white/50">ZCode — D:\MYCODE\gomoku-ai</span>
  </div>

  <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-[180px_1fr]">
    <!-- 任务侧栏 -->
    <div class="hidden border-r border-white/10 p-4 sm:block">
      <p class="mb-3 text-[11px] font-medium tracking-widest text-white/40">任务</p>
      <ul class="space-y-2.5 text-xs">
        <li class="flex items-center gap-2 rounded-lg bg-white/10 px-2.5 py-1.5 text-white">
          <span class="h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-zblue"></span>修复宠物拖动竞态
        </li>
        <li class="flex items-center gap-2 px-2.5 py-1.5 text-white/60">
          <span class="h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-ok"></span>重构 parser 模块
        </li>
        <li class="flex items-center gap-2 px-2.5 py-1.5 text-white/60">
          <span class="h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-ok"></span>补齐单测
        </li>
        <li class="flex items-center gap-2 px-2.5 py-1.5 text-white/60">
          <span class="h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-white/30"></span>发布 v0.1.0
        </li>
      </ul>
      <p class="mt-5 text-[11px] text-white/30">GoalComplete · 89K tokens</p>
    </div>

    <!-- 会话流 -->
    <div class="flex min-h-[300px] flex-col p-4 sm:p-5">
      <div class="space-y-3.5 text-xs leading-relaxed sm:text-sm">
        <div class="flex justify-end">
          <p class="max-w-[85%] rounded-xl rounded-br-sm bg-white/10 px-3.5 py-2 text-white/90">
            帮我修一下宠物不能拖动的 bug，好像是和点击穿透的竞态。
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="text-white/70">
          <p>
            已定位根因：穿透守护线程每 200ms 检测光标，拖动一开始就把穿透打开了。
            我改成 <span class="text-white">mousedown 阈值 + 拖拽期守护静默</span>，正在改 3 个文件。
          </p>
          <p class="mt-2 font-mono text-[11px] text-white/40">● Edit src/main.js · ● Edit lib.rs · ⋯</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Z-Buddy 状态条（窗口右下角，本产品在演示里的位置感） -->
      <div class="mt-auto flex items-center gap-3 rounded-xl border border-white/10 bg-white/5 px-3 py-2.5">
        <img
          src={withBase('pets/mochi-loop.webp')}
          alt="团子正在工作的循环动画"
          class="pixelated h-12 w-12"
          width="48"
          height="48"
        />
        <div class="min-w-0">
          <p class="text-xs font-medium text-white">团子 <span class="text-white/50">· working</span></p>
          <p class="truncate text-[11px] text-white/50">ZCode 干活中，点一下团子可以随时暂停</p>
        </div>
        <span class="ml-auto flex shrink-0 items-center gap-1 whitespace-nowrap rounded-full bg-white/10 px-2.5 py-1 text-[10px] text-white/70">
          <span class="h-1.5 w-1.5 animate-pulse rounded-full bg-ok"></span>运行中
        </span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
